   "text": "interface Store (store/types.ts)\n──────────\nuserByEmail · userById · userByGoogle · userByAuthId\ninsertUser (DuplicateError) · updateUser\ncreateSession · sessionUser · deleteSession\nhit(key, windowMs) → count\nenqueue(job) · enqueueLimited(job, maxActive)\nclaim(workerId, leaseMs, kind?)\nheartbeat · setProgress · finish (fenced)\nrelease (no attempt counted)\njob · jobByKey · activeJobs\nqueueDepth · queuePosition · queueStats\nmetrics(windowMs) → p50 / p95\nsaveRecording · recordings · recording\nping · close",
   "originalText": "interface Store (store/types.ts)\n──────────\nuserByEmail · userById · userByGoogle · userByAuthId\ninsertUser (DuplicateError) · updateUser\ncreateSession · sessionUser · deleteSession\nhit(key, windowMs) → count\nenqueue(job) · enqueueLimited(job, maxActive)\nclaim(workerId, leaseMs, kind?)\nheartbeat · setProgress · finish (fenced)\nrelease (no attempt counted)\njob · jobByKey · activeJobs\nqueueDepth · queuePosition · queueStats\nmetrics(windowMs) → p50 / p95\nsaveRecording · recordings · recording\nping · close",
