   "text": "interface MediaStore (media/store.ts)\n──────────\npublish(id, localDir, files)\nlocate(id, file) → {path} | {redirect} | null\nLocalMedia — recordings/<id>/\nS3Media — SigV4 PUT, presigned GET 15 min",
   "originalText": "interface MediaStore (media/store.ts)\n──────────\npublish(id, localDir, files)\nlocate(id, file) → {path} | {redirect} | null\nLocalMedia — recordings/<id>/\nS3Media — SigV4 PUT, presigned GET 15 min",
